# Collapse trailing-slash duplicates to the canonical (no-slash) URL. The site
# canonicalizes to no-slash everywhere (canonical, sitemap, internal links);
# these 301s make the host agree on a single URL per page.
# Effective on Cloudflare Pages / Netlify (copied to build/_redirects). For
# Vercel, mirror these in vercel.json `redirects`.
/about/            /about            301
/download/         /download         301
/privacy/          /privacy          301
# Scheme A: the /app reader tree is gone (hooks 308s /app/** one hop to the
# new shapes). Host-level /app 301s here would only add a second hop on top of
# the 308 — they are gone, not redirected. Only no-slash marketing spellings
# remain below.
